    5. Place distractor 2x2 blocks and 1x1 pixels at positions that do not overlap existing objects
    6. Build output -- 3x3 black grid with first N diagonal cells set to blue
  notes:
    - adjacency between objects is allowed; only overlap is forbidden
    - ensure grid is large enough to fit all objects (reject if placement fails)
