+      `r0..r1` and columns `< c0`, `R` in rows `r0..r1` and columns `> c1`,
+      `U` in columns `c0..c1` and rows `< r0`, and `D` in columns `c0..c1`
+      and rows `> r1`.
+    - Remove all force dots, then translate that whole object by `(D-U, R-L)`.
